     "<div dir=\"rtl\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Thanks Yoni,</div><div dir=\"ltr\"><br></div><div dir=\"ltr\">I tried     Temp$HEBREW &lt;- iconv(Temp$DSC_ITEM, &quot;Latin1&quot;, &quot;UTF-8&quot;) but didn&#39;t get Hebrew.<br></div><div dir=\"ltr\">Is there a way to get the correct &quot;from&quot; encoding?</div><div dir=\"ltr\"><br></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><br></div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
